<title>UK: TENNIS-EURO/AFRICAN DAVIS CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EURO/AFRICAN DAVIS CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euro/African zone Davis Cup</p>
<p>results on Friday:</p>
<p>Group two playoffs</p>
<p>In Tbilisi, Georgia lead Nigeria 2-0</p>
<p>David Kacharava  beat Jean-Louis Abelekan  6-1 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Vladimir Gabrichidze  beat Sule Ladipo  6-3 6-2 6-3  </p>
<p>Euro/African zone group two play-offs:</p>
<p>In Cairo: Egypt and Lithuania level 1-1</p>
<p>Rolandas Murashka (Lithuania) beat Jihad ad-Deeb (Egypt) 4-6</p>
<p>6-4 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Amr Ghoneim (Egypt) beat Eugenijus Cariovas (Lithuania) 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 6-4</p>
<p>In Maia, Portugal: Portugal and Yugoslavia level 1-1</p>
<p>Joao Cunha e Silva (Portugal) beat Nenad Zimonjic</p>
<p>(Yugoslavia) 2-6 6-4 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Bojan Vujic (Yugoslavia) beat Emanuel Couto (Portugal) 6-3</p>
<p>7-5 5-7 6-2.</p>
</text>
